      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::rubric_card::000::20ee1126b8"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting material is a WVTaTiCr refractory high-entropy-alloy coating.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::rubric_card::000::20ee1126b8"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed coating is intended to operate under sliding contact from approximately 800°C to 1200°C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::rubric_card::000::20ee1126b8"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr addition induces precipitation of Cr-rich phases in WVTaTiCr.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the proposed Cr-rich precipitates is the Cr2Ta Laves phase.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-temperature exposure of WVTaTiCr produces surface oxides.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::rubric_card::000::20ee1126b8"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The high-temperature surface products form a network of stable oxide phases.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed oxide network contains Cr2O3, TiO2, and associated complex oxides.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-containing alloy forms a continuous, protective, lubricious oxide layer during high-temperature operation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed oxide layer lowers friction during sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed oxide layer lowers wear during sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The underlying BCC refractory-HEA matrix retains mechanical robustness at high temperature.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::rubric_card::000::20ee1126b8"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combining the oxide layer with the strong underlying matrix provides both self-lubrication and high mechanical strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "WVTaTiCr will have a lower friction coefficient than Cr-free WVTaTi over a wide temperature range.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "WVTaTiCr will have a lower wear rate than Cr-free WVTaTi over a wide temperature range.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "WVTaTiCr will maintain high strength while providing improved tribological performance.",
